sequenceDiagram
    participant You as Your code
    participant M as Model
    participant T as Tool (a Python function)
    You->>M: question + the list of tools it may ask for
    M-->>You: "call add(a=2, b=3)"
    You->>T: run add(2, 3)
    T-->>You: 5
    You->>M: the tool returned 5
    M-->>You: "The answer is 5."